extends /specs/products/pericles/page-structure/structure/templates/structure/layout-tmpl.jade

block content
    h1 Coolbar

    .source_info
        p Colors, font sizes and margins changed based on the
            | !{''}
            a(href="https://projects.invisionapp.com/d/main#/console/12228601/258969606/preview") new design

    markdown
        p Make any element sticky using HTML Classes, `stickybar` as a parent class and `stickybar__wrapper` as a child class


    section.source_section
        h2 Abstract view
        markdown
            p `Go to full text` changed to `Read the full text` based on <a href='https://jira.atypon.com/browse/LIT-200481' target="_blank">`LIT-200481`</a>


        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('coolbar', 'coolbar/demo/demo-abst-coolbar', 'pericles')}


    section.source_section
        h2 Full view with no access

        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('coolbar', 'coolbar/demo/demo-full-coolbar-noaccess', 'pericles')}

    section.source_section
        h2 Full view with access

        markdown
            p note: i removed class `coolBar--sections` from the sections wrapper for demonstration purpose

        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('coolbar', 'coolbar/demo/demo-full-coolbar-access', 'pericles')}